```

```mdl
decision D-74: At startup the app runs the navigation handlers on the URL's query. While the join dialog they open is up, the app opens no space; if the dialog is dismissed with no space open, the app opens the last space or runs the first run. Whether a join failed is the join panel's call, and the panel shows it. Fills in [D-70].
